---
source: tests/parser.rs
expression: "tree(r\"$\\bE [ x + y ] .$\")"
---
ROOT@0..17
  PARAGRAPH@0..17
    INLINE_MATH@0..17
      DOLLAR@0..1 "$"
      MATH@1..16
        COMMAND@1..4
          CONTROL_WORD@1..4 "\\bE"
        WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
        L_BRACKET@5..6 "["
        WHITESPACE@6..7 " "
        WORD@7..8 "x"
        WHITESPACE@8..9 " "
        WORD@9..10 "+"
        WHITESPACE@10..11 " "
        WORD@11..12 "y"
        WHITESPACE@12..13 " "
        R_BRACKET@13..14 "]"
        WHITESPACE@14..15 " "
        WORD@15..16 "."
      DOLLAR@16..17 "$"
